      "fit": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "A hiring choice by a filmmaker making a decision that affects many workers led to a pile-on in the digital space. Online accusers made it a culture war, framing the casting as an attack on ordinary people's heritage. The whole situation has become a mess that has divided ordinary fans and hurt the people making the movie, who are just trying to do their jobs.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Everyman",
        "fragments": [
          "how-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "result-0"
        ],
